## Project acknowledgement (not a software license)

The project documentation includes a letter dated 16 November 2026 from
Dr. Shilpi Vijay of Back in Action Physiotherapy Clinic acknowledging the
VERTEBRATE concept and expressing interest in its potential. The letter
explicitly states that it is not clinical validation, approval of the current
prototype, or a commitment to implementation or financial sponsorship. It
grants no rights to this software or to any third-party software or model
assets, and does not change the MIT License above. See
[`docs/acknowledgements/vertebrate-clinic-acknowledgement-2026-11-16.pdf`](docs/acknowledgements/vertebrate-clinic-acknowledgement-2026-11-16.pdf)
and the project's [README](README.md#project-acknowledgement).
